{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobx1o4XT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobug13aZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mob4fVdp9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobUFrna2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "弓木ねえちゃん田村ねえちゃんが撮ってくれた。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "撮るの上手すぎこんなの別人すぎ。とほほ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうね(..)"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobljDXvj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こちらも楽しく撮ってもらった。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がいつもコソコソしてるから、撮ろうか？と声をかけてくれる。優しいです。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "髪を短くしたときは、衣装で首元にネックレスやチョーカーを付けるのが好きだった。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さりげなさが大事ね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと憧れの存在を追いかけています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "25歳になりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "身体を大事に頑張ります。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://nogizaka46.lnk.to/BirthdayPlaylist"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさん、いつも応援してくれて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しい一年にします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遠藤さくら"}], "source": "official"}